  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "节目播不播  (Malicious Rumours and Broadcast Dilemma)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "stella": "斯戴拉"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Fabricated scandal photos targeting Xin Huimei suddenly flood the internet, and Xingzi, Kaiwen, and public-relations director Stella weigh the fallout if her charity talk-show episode airs. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "有人在网上发了照片，说是富豪拍的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不过这有点过分吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "哪个富豪能忍得了她呀？估计就是刷曝光率吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "再刷就报废了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "上礼拜她在录节目的时候，要是有这事肯定好看啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "她在这文娱论上说这么多关于慈善基金的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "等这两天节目一播，就是等着被打脸了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那也不能不播呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你要把她这段掐了，不怕整个公关部被烦死吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "要找也是找我们制作一部。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "有人在网上发了照片，说是富豪拍的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Someone posted photos online claiming they were taken by a wealthy tycoon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不过这有点过分吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That goes way too far, though.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "哪个富豪能忍得了她呀？估计就是刷曝光率吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What tycoon could put up with her temper? People probably think she is chasing publicity.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "再刷就报废了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Any more publicity like that and her career would be ruined.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "上礼拜她在录节目的时候，要是有这事肯定好看啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If this had broken while she was taping last week, that episode would have been explosive.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "她在这文娱论上说这么多关于慈善基金的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On Entertainment Talk she spoke at length about her charity foundation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "等这两天节目一播，就是等着被打脸了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once the episode airs in the next couple of days, it will look like an instant humiliation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那也不能不播呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, we cannot just cancel the broadcast!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你要把她这段掐了，不怕整个公关部被烦死吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you cut her segment out, are you not afraid her fans will hound our entire PR department?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "要找也是找我们制作一部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even if they come after someone, they will come after our Production Unit One.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "有人在网上发了照片，说是富豪拍的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
